, "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:55.966155+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_1"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:55.966155+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_2"}, {"at": "2026-10-02T17:01:55.966155+00:00", "by": {"type": "pipeline", "stage": "deterministic_svg"}, "operation": "remove", "transformation_target_id": "asset:formula_3"}]}, "normalized_content": {"assets": [{"alt": "", "url": "/assets/0960b93f-bbae-4698-aa47-5fdcef49f272", "kind": "ordinary_image", "asset_id": "0960b93f-bbae-4698-aa47-5fdcef49f272", "asset_key": "image_1", "transformation_target_id": "asset:image_1"}], "format": "teacherhelper-normalized", "sections": [{"key": "condition", "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"0960b93f-bbae-4698-aa47-5fdcef49f272\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/0960b93f-bbae-4698-aa47-5fdcef49f272\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{k}{x}+ax+b\"></span>. Най­ди­те <i>a</i>.</p>", "title": "Условие", "asset_keys": ["image_1"], "section_id": "condition:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"}, {"key": "answer", "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">1</span></p>", "title": "Ответ", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "answer:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"}, {"key": "solution", "html": "<p>Пре­об­ра­зу­ем дан­ную функ­цию:</p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=\\frac{kx+a}{x+b}=\\frac{kx+kb+a-kb}{x+b}=\\frac{kx+kb}{x+b}+\\frac{a-kb}{x+b}=k+\\frac{a-kb}{x+b}\"></span> . </p></center><p>Гра­фик функ­ции имеет го­ри­зон­таль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>y</i>  =  −2, зна­чит, <i>k</i>  =  −2. Гра­фик функ­ции имеет вер­ти­каль­ную асимп­то­ту <i>x</i>  =  3, зна­чит, <i>b</i>  =  −3. По гра­фи­ку, <i>f</i>(2)  =  3, тогда</p><center><p> <span data-inline-latex=\"-2+\\frac{a-6}{2-3}=3\\iff \\frac{a-6}{-1}=5\\iff a-6=-5\\iff a=1\"></span>. </p></center>", "title": "Решение", "asset_keys": [], "section_id": "solution:1", "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"}], "schema_version": 3, "problem_reference_ids": {"prototype_problem_id": null, "group_parent_problem_id": null, "adjacent_group_parent_problem_id": null}}}